            "text": "<p>We have these shoes in a beautiful Sky Suede color. My son loved them so much that he put them on immediately when he saw them and refused to take them off. Petit Nord shoes are the only ones on the market that meet all my criteria: high quality, comfort, style, and cute design. I highly recommend them as a mom who values style and quality, especially for my picky son who prioritizes comfort.</p>",
            "label": "<p>Inna R.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
          }
        },
